Changes made to the copy in this repository:

  - imports rewritten from `@/core/*` and `@/composables/*` to
    `@/liquid-glass/*`;
  - non-null assertions added on array indices, which this repository's
    `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` requires and the original does not;
  - the bottom tabs capsule blur reduced from 8px to 4px;
  - `RippleSurface`'s host dropped its `overflow: hidden`. The host takes
    the control's `border-radius`, and a rounded clipped ancestor makes
    Chromium skip the SVG-filter half of a nested surface's
    `backdrop-filter`; the ripple is clipped by `.ripple-host__clip`
    instead, which is a sibling of the glass rather than an ancestor.
